                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Intercollegiate Ethics Bowl Champions\nThe Cendara Debate Society triumphed in the Northeast Intercollegiate Ethics Bowl, defeating nine regional universities, March 2024.",
                        "depth": 0
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Meridian Technology Prize Finalist\nTeam AquaAdapt (Katherine Su, Omar Bedeir, Linh Phan) reached the finals for their development of an affordable portable water purifier, April 2024.",
                        "depth": 0
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "First Place, National Short Film Festival\n“Reflections of Tomorrow,” directed by senior media studies student Elena DiLuca, won top honors for original screenplay, November 2023.",
